ly","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company plans to focus on scaling its secured micro loan against property business throughout the year after stabilizing the process.","quote":"Controlled expansion of Secured Loan (Micro Loan Against Property) with focus on process stabilization and eventual scale up; Will continue to focus on scaling throughout the year.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":59.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The bank has set a target to provide 60,000 crores of incremental financing to positive social and environmental sectors by fiscal year 2030.","quote":"Incremental financing of Rs. 60,000 Crores under Wholesale Banking to sectors with positive social and environmental outcomes, by FY 2030","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":49.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The bank is positioned to take advantage of the active corporate bond market.","quote":"We remain well placed to benefit from a vibrant Corporate Bond market","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":33.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Invoicemart has facilitated price discovery for MSMEs across more than 1,100 Indian locations to discount bills.","quote":"Invoicemart has helped in price discovery for MSMEs across 1,100+ locations in India who are now able to get their bills discounted from 74 financiers","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISBANK1_18072026132045_IRRevisedSigned.pdf","page":58.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Higher technol